      "content": "i hear you on the safety stuff, but i'm just really struggling with this mood dip and it's getting hard to function. if i just monitor my own bruising and maybe get my finger pricked at home to check my levels every few days, wouldn't that be enough to keep me safe while i try the 150mg? it feels like such a small thing to try before i go through the whole ordeal of a doctor's appointment and more bloodwork. if i'm careful, i really think i can manage it myself.",
